Fri Oct 23 15:39:51 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 5.1.1:
  * Tests that depend on the build environment are now gated
    behind the `gated-tests` cargo feature (off by default);
    this fixes the daemon unit test failure on aarch64 with
    glibc 2.43 and newer.
  * Refresh bundled UI dependencies since 4.3.1 (axios 1.15.2
    to 1.20.0, svgo 3.3.3 to 3.3.5, browserslist 4.28.2 to
    4.28.8), fixing the following CVEs:
  * CVE-2026-67312: axios unbounded recursion in form data
    path parsing, call stack overflow (boo#1273565)
  * CVE-2026-67313: axios unbounded recursion in nested
    bracket path parsing, form data serialization denial of
    service (boo#1273624)
  * CVE-2026-67314: axios inherited prototype properties in
    Basic auth header parsing, outbound request tampering
    (boo#1273635)
  * CVE-2026-67315: axios 0.0.0.0 not treated as local in
    proxy bypass, local service requests misrouted
    (boo#1273640)
  * CVE-2026-67316: axios inherited prototype properties in
    bodyless method aliases, unauthorized request bodies
    (boo#1273655)
  * CVE-2026-67317: axios upload limit bypass for unmeasured
    streaming bodies, resource exhaustion (boo#1273675)
  * CVE-2026-67318: axios maxBodyLength bypass on HTTP/2
    streamed bodies, resource exhaustion (boo#1273697)
  * CVE-2026-67319: axios nested request options as plain
    objects under prototype pollution, header injection
    (boo#1273717)
  * CVE-2026-67320: axios inherited prototype properties in
    interceptor-cloned config, unauthorized proxying
    (boo#1273725)
  * CVE-2026-67321: axios depth check bypass via object keys
    ending in {} in form serialization, denial of service
    (boo#1273732)
  * CVE-2026-73650: svgo removeScripts plugin leaves
    executable scripts intact, possible XSS (boo#1275336)
  * CVE-2026-73088: browserslist prototype pollution via
    unguarded for...in over untrusted keys (boo#1275389)

